WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.890
- We're gonna do the egg test.

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.380
- I don't wanna risk crushing an egg

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.110
all over my hand and mattress
and sheets and everything,

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.570
so I kinda split the difference.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.870
- Pushing down on the egg.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.724
It's all the way down!

00:00:12.724 --> 00:00:16.218
(plastic crinkling)

00:00:16.218 --> 00:00:17.455
(laughing)

00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:18.740
We're going to be using Purple products

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.735
for a week to see if it
helps our sleeping problems.

00:00:22.735 --> 00:00:25.818
(light plucky music)

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.000
- I have a little bit of sleep trouble.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.920
I have lots of old basketball
injuries and stuff,

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.570
I've broken both my ankles before.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.510
- Seven years ago, I actually fell

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.930
through a trap door,

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:38.360
and I caught my arm on the stairs.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:41.760
Basically I have whiplash and
pinched nerve in my check.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.810
- Like my back will hurt, my neck hurts.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.560
And I wake up a lot and I just, I'm achy.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.810
- So the first thing is when
you actually get the mattress,

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:50.710
it weights a million pounds.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:52.720
It's so much heavier than it looks.

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.110
When you get it actually on the bed,

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:56.530
it's like in this cool shrink-wrap.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:57.680
It's growing.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:58.660
It's so weird.

00:00:59.836 --> 00:01:01.412
(rustling)

00:01:01.412 --> 00:01:02.462
- Okay, this is cute.

00:01:03.535 --> 00:01:06.260
Oh my God, this feels amazing.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.910
- The pillow is very comfortable.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:11.385
It also weighs 40 pounds
and is made of materials

00:01:11.385 --> 00:01:13.735
that you would never
expect to see in a pillow.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.680
What is this?

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:19.940
This is so trippy.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.330
So weird.

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:23.260
- Oh, shit.

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:25.930
Oh my God.

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:27.610
Oh, I am sweating.

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:29.910
Oh my God, Pete, tell
me, what do you think?

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:31.507
The pillow feels like a butt.

00:01:31.507 --> 00:01:32.340
(laughing)

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:33.180
It feels like a butt.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.050
So it feels like you're just

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:35.340
napping on someone's butt.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:38.960
Last night I tried to go
to bed at nine o'clock.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:39.860
And it worked.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:42.790
- My back feels better
than it normally does.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:45.016
I did wake up a few
times during the night.

00:01:45.016 --> 00:01:47.310
But nothing too crazy.

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:50.497
- First night I had a
really bad crick in my neck.

00:01:50.497 --> 00:01:53.820
Maybe it's just getting
used to the pillow?

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:55.980
And I think it was also too tall.

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.520
It came with these pads

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:59.840
that made it taller and thicker.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:03.010
And the first night I
realized I didn't like that.

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:05.510
So I took those out and it
was much more comfortable.

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:07.330
It was perfect for my neck.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:11.490
- Part of this video should
be that we get to stay home

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:12.790
and be on the bed all day.

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:15.123
That's...

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.550
That would be a good test.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:22.050
- When I did open it, mine
had powdery stuff inside.

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.860
I think it's from the rubber a little bit.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:25.180
When they cut it or something?

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:27.368
There's kinda like a natural,

00:02:27.368 --> 00:02:28.590
I don't know what it was,
it wasn't a big deal.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:30.310
But it was kinda weird.

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:31.910
And then after that, I was like,

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:34.030
every time the air wooshed out,

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:35.920
you kinda smell the rubber a little bit,

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.160
and I was like (sniffing)

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:38.524
am I inhaling that white powder?

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:39.357
(laughing)

00:02:39.357 --> 00:02:40.190
What is this?

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:42.490
I woke up this morning
and my hip is pretty sore.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:45.780
So I'd kinda hoped that
the purple would make

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.490
more of a difference on that.

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:49.710
But seems like maybe
that's just unavoidable.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:53.380
- This pillow, since
it was so iffy for me,

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.940
I just used it as a pillow that

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.060
would accompany my current pillow.

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:00.510
I'd just switch back and forth.

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:01.870
- It wasn't a miracle cure.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.540
Like I would still have some
back soreness in the mornings,

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.610
or if I slept on my wrong side,

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:09.600
then I would have hip pain a little bit.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:12.000
But it drastically reduced

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.160
how many times I woke up during the night.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.760
- I mean this could also be
my anti-anxiety medicine,

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.540
but I also felt a lot less anxious.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:22.844
It created a space where I
could just really just relax.

00:03:22.844 --> 00:03:25.844
(light happy music)

00:03:33.147 --> 00:03:33.980
(wooshing)

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.279
(squeaking)

